    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3 Bedroom Terraced Home | Approx. 85 m² | BER B3 | Ready to Move In\r\n\r\nSalley Property Services are delighted to present 101 Inchicore Road, a beautifully presented three-bedroom terraced home extending to approximately 85 m² and ideally positioned in the heart of Inchicore, Dublin 8.\r\n\r\nRecently redecorated throughout and presented in excellent condition, this attractive home is ready for immediate occupation, allowing the new owners to simply move in and enjoy. Bright, comfortable and well-proportioned accommodation makes the property an excellent choice for first-time buyers, families, investors or anyone seeking a conveniently located home within easy reach of Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\n\r\n101 Inchicore Road enjoys an excellent Dublin 8 location, with a wide variety of shops, cafés, schools, sporting facilities and everyday amenities within easy reach.  The beautiful War Memorial Gardens are within a couple of minutes walk..\r\n\r\nInchicore is a well-established and increasingly popular residential area, offering excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The property is conveniently positioned for public transport links and provides straightforward access to the city centre, making it an attractive option for commuters.\r\n\r\nThe wider area also benefits from proximity to Kilmainham and the many amenities available throughout Dublin 8."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation comprises of an open plan Kitchen/Diner/Lounge, three bedrooms and two bathrooms.  The property benefits from gas-fired heating together with an impressive B3 BER rating, offering a good standard of energy efficiency.\r\n\r\nTo the rear is a private garden featuring decking arranged over two levels, creating an attractive and versatile outdoor space ideal for relaxing, entertaining or outdoor dining. On-street parking is available to the front of the property.\r\n\r\nBER: B3\r\nBER Number: 105915045\r\nFloor Area: Approx. 85 m²"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Key Features\r\n\r\nThree-bedroom terraced home\r\n\r\nBathrooms x 2\r\n\r\nReady to move in\r\n\r\nRecently redecorated throughout\r\n\r\nApprox. 85 m²\r\n\r\nBER B3\r\n\r\nGas-fired heating\r\n\r\nPrivate rear garden\r\n\r\nAttractive two-level decking\r\n\r\nOn-street parking\r\n\r\nConvenient Dublin 8 location\r\n\r\nExcellent access to Dublin City Centre\r\n\r\nClose to local shops, schools and amenities"
      },
      {
